    "innovation": "This paper introduces and quantifies a \"break-even albedo\"\u2014the point where net radiation is equal under sunny and cloudy skies\u2014to determine whether clouds cool or warm the Arctic surface, finding the effect depends on the monthly evolution of surface conditions like snow, ice, and melt ponds.",
